# Tenhou counterpart: Pao ron from the liable seat itself pays 100% + honba
# (engine.md §4.2 Pao, rules.md §1 pao_ron_split, §4.31).
# Honba: 1.
# Seat 1 pons 5z (from S0), 6z (from S3), 7z (from S2 -> sets Daisangen pao on Seat 2).
# Seat 2 (the liable seat itself) discards 7s -> Seat 1 rons 7s!
# Seat 2 pays 100% of Daisangen (32000) + 300 honba = 32300.

[meta]
